Changes in the chemical and biological characteristics of grape marc
vermicompost during a two-year production period
Natielo Almeida Santanaa,⁎, Rodrigo Josemar Seminoti Jacquesa, Zaida Inês Antoniollia, Hugo Martínez-Cordeirob, Jorge Domínguezb
a Federal University of Santa Maria, Department of Soil Science, 97119-900 Santa Maria, Rio Grande do Sul, Brazil b Grupo de Ecoloxía Animal (GEA), Universidade de Vigo, E-36310 Vigo, Pontevedra, Spain
